/// The state of one notice DOCUMENT.
///
/// Not the same question as `PotentialChange.noticeStatus`, which answers
/// "does this change need a notice at all". This answers "where has this
/// particular piece of paper got to", and the two are deliberately separate:
/// a change can need a notice long before one exists, and a superseded draft
/// still has to be readable years later.
enum NoticeIssueStatus {
  draft
  /// Both seats approved and it has been handed to the courier. NOT proof it
  /// left the building.
  issued
  /// The courier reported back with a message id. This is the proof.
  sent
  acknowledged
  /// A rejected round, kept whole. Never edited, never deleted.
  superseded
}

